{
  "id": "1CH.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Chronicles 22",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David commanded to gather together the aliens who were in the land of Israel, and he set stonecutters to prepare dressed stones for building the house of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David also provided great stores of iron for nails for the doors of the gates and for clamps, as well as bronze in quantities beyond weighing, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and cedar timbers without number; for the Sidonians and Tyrians brought great quantities of cedar to David. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For David said, “Solomon my son is young and inexperienced, and the house that is to be built for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " must be exceedingly magnificent, of fame and glory throughout all lands; I will therefore make preparation for it.” So David provided materials in great quantity before his death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he called for Solomon his son, and charged him to build a house for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David said to Solomon, “My son, I had it in my heart to build a house to the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " my God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me, saying, ‘You have shed much blood and have waged great wars; you shall not build a house to my name, because you have shed so much blood before me upon the earth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, a son shall be born to you; he shall be a man of peace. I will give him peace from all his enemies round about; for his name shall be Solomon, and I will give peace and quiet to Israel in his days. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall build a house for my name. He shall be my son, and I will be his father, and I will establish his royal throne in Israel for ever.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, my son, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " be with you, so that you may succeed in building the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, as he has spoken concerning you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Only, may the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " grant you discretion and understanding, that when he gives you charge over Israel you may keep the law of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will prosper if you are careful to observe the statutes and the ordinances which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded Moses for Israel. Be strong, and of good courage. Fear not; be not dismayed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With great pains I have provided for the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a hundred thousand talents of gold, a million talents of silver, and bronze and iron beyond weighing, for there is so much of it; timber and stone too I have provided. To these you must add. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have an abundance of workmen: stonecutters, masons, carpenters, and all kinds of craftsmen without number, skilled in working ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gold, silver, bronze, and iron. Arise and be doing! The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " be with you!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David also commanded all the leaders of Israel to help Solomon his son, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Is not the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God with you? And has he not given you peace on every side? For he has delivered the inhabitants of the land into my hand; and the land is subdued before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and his people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now set your mind and heart to seek the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. Arise and build the sanctuary of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God, so that the ark of the covenant of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and the holy vessels of God may be brought into a house built for the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
